> A hand-checkable calculation

At a time limit the final-state value4 yields advantage4.1; physical termination supplies bootstrap0 and gives.5. Both boundaries cut the trace before auto-reset observations.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/ppo_vsim_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
