> Actual source diagnostics

These are captured source measurements, in original execution order. They retain weak results and explicit availability flags. Distinct tasks may use different reward scales; a smoke run does not establish convergence.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/ppo_vsim_diagnostic0.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
